[00:00.000] 作词 : 艾迪娜
[00:01.000] 作曲 : 艾迪娜
[00:26.663]Followed you down to the rivers
[00:34.426]You were never afraid of the waters
[00:42.913]Or the many eyes on the cypress tree trunks
[00:48.100]Watching closely
[00:51.608]Our discreet whispers
[00:54.101]The way you touched me
[00:57.103]I felt heavenly
[01:02.107]
[01:04.598]We were lying in the meadow
[01:12.353]Time was but a notion forgotten by the moments
[01:21.599]We were lying in the meadow
[01:28.847]
[01:29.347]the many eyes on the cypress tree trunks
[01:34.352]you heard them weep
[01:38.346]For the mothers in our family
[01:43.097]Oh one of them I’ll never be
[01:48.359]
[01:49.347]I will follow you down to those rivers
[01:58.098]You were never afraid of the waters
[02:05.846]
[02:30.602]Do you remember when you said
[02:36.610]Why did they choose the moon
[02:41.846]Over the sun over the trees
[02:43.597]I didn’t know then I wouldn’t know now
[02:49.353]Cause we chose to stop believing
[02:54.851]
[02:59.851]We were lying in the meadow
[03:06.598]Time was but a notion forgotten by the moments
[03:16.350]We could lie there forever
[03:23.852]Time was but a notion forgotten by the moments
[03:33.109]We were lying in the meadow
[03:39.597]
[03:44.596]With the wind and falling leaves
[03:53.105]I was singing you to sleep
